#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge8/scripts.inc:16
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge8_Text_WhatATrainerNeeds"
msgid ""
"What a TRAINER needs…\p"
"Knowledge…\n"
"Strategy…\l"
"Luck…\l"
"Guts…\l"
"Spirit…\l"
"Bravery…\l"
"And ability…\p"
"Well, I'm all set in every way!\n"
"I'll be unstoppable at every building!\p"
"Huh? POKéMON?\n"
"What's that?$"
msgstr ""
"训练家需要的是……\p"
"知识……\n"
"战术……\l"
"运气……\l"
"毅力……\l"
"精神……\l"
"勇气……\l"
"还有能力……\p"
"嗯，这些我全都具备了！\n"
"我在每座设施都会所向无敌！\p"
"咦？宝可梦？\n"
"那是什么？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge8/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge8_Text_KnowAboutFrontierBrains"
msgid ""
"Do you know about the FRONTIER\n"
"BRAINS?\p"
"That's what SCOTT calls the seven\n"
"special TRAINERS that run the seven\l"
"facilities in the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道开拓头脑吗？\p"
"亚希达这样称呼\n"
"管理对战开拓区7座设施的\l"
"7位特别的训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge8/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge8_Text_ToldMeIHaveTalentForBattling"
msgid ""
"At the BATTLE TOWER, an older girl\n"
"told me that I have a lot of talent\l"
"for battling!\p"
"I like POKéMON CONTESTS more!\p"
"But I'm no good at CONTESTS!\p"
"I guess having talent and liking\n"
"something aren't the same.$"
msgstr ""
"在对战塔，有个大姐姐说\n"
"我很有对战的天赋！\p"
"可我更喜欢宝可梦华丽大赛！\p"
"但是我在华丽大赛上一点也不行！\p"
"看来有天赋和喜欢\n"
"并不是一回事啊。$"
